OL,3,GNEWSAFamily 'isolated' by 16-month
OL,4,Abedbug infestation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA family says they have been left
OL,7,F"isolated" by a bedbug infestation that
OL,8,Fhas plagued their home for 16 months.
OL,10,FStephen Long, from Coleford,
OL,11,FGloucestershire, has called on housing
OL,12,Fassociation Stonewater, which owns the
OL,13,Fproperty, to eradicate the insects.
OL,15,FLong says he, his partner, and his
OL,16,Fstep-daughter - all of whom are
OL,17,Fdisabled - have been forced to sleep in
OL,18,Fthe living room and have become
OL,19,F"increasingly isolated" due to concerns
OL,20,Fabout spreading the bugs to other
OL,21,Fpeople's homes.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
