OL,3,GNEWSAFamily 'isolated' by 16-month
OL,4,Abedbug infestation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for Stonewater said the
OL,7,Fassociation had arranged and paid for
OL,8,Fextensive treatments to tackle the
OL,9,Fproblem, as well as replacing bedding
OL,10,Fand furniture, but could not fund
OL,11,Ffurther help.
